# Force LF line endings for all text files. Without this, Windows clones
# default to CRLF, which would ship CRLF inside files the installer copies
# into other people's repositories (skills, runtime scripts) and break their
# content hashes in lock files.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never line-end-normalize.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
